<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 4.7 points to 804.4 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 4.7 points to 804.4 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 4.7 points on Thursday to 804.4, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Five of the ten sectoral indices gained, with the foods and beverages index rising the most, up 13.7 points to 1,108.5.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
